  @.5504 text ") differs from Location in that the Content-Location refers to the most specific resource corresponding to the enclosed representation. It is therefore possible for a response to contain both the Location and Content-Location header fields."
  @.5505 link "10.2.3. " url="/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-10.2.3"
  @.5507 link "Retry-After" url="/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-retry-after"
  @.5509 text "Servers send the "Retry-After" header field to indicate how long the user agent ought to wait before making a follow-up request. When sent with a "
  @.5510 link "503 (Service Unavailable)" url="/rfc/rfc9110.html#status.503"
