  @.6459 link "If-Unmodified-Since" url="/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-if-unmodified-since"
  @.6461 text "The "If-Unmodified-Since" header field makes the request method conditional on the "
  @.6462 link "selected representation" url=$u1
  @.6464 text "'s last modification date being earlier than or equal to the date provided in the field value. This field accomplishes the same purpose as "
