  @.7572 link "200 (OK)" url=$u1
  @.7574 text " response by a transforming proxy ("
  @.7575 link "Section 7.7" url="/rfc/rfc9110.html#message.transformations"
  @.7577 text "). This status code allows the proxy to notify recipients when a transformation has been applied, since that knowledge might impact later decisions regarding the content. For example, future cache validation requests for the content might only be applicable along the same request path (through the same proxies).A 203 response is heuristically cacheable; i.e., unless otherwise indicated by the method definition or explicit cache controls (see "
  @.7579 link "Section 4.2.2" url=$u2
  @.7581 text " of ["
